      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Reject nonfinite OpenAI cost values",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- reject non-finite numeric and numeric-string values in OpenAI Admin API cost responses\n- prevent `NaN`/infinity from contaminating cost totals and breaking JSON output\n- preserve existing support for valid numeric strings\n- add focused coverage for `\"NaN\"`, `\"Infinity\"`, and overflowing `\"1e309\"`\n\n## After-fix behavior proof\n\nThe freshly built production cost parser was run with three malformed API values. Each now fails at the `costs` decode boundary instead of producing a non-finite `costUSD` value:\n\n```text\nOpenAIAPIUsageFetcherTests\n  value → \"NaN\" passed\n  value → \"Infinity\" passed\n  value → \"1e309\" passed\n  12 tests passed\n```\n\nThis protects the downstream `OpenAIAPIUsageSnapshot` and CLI JSON encoder, which cannot represent `NaN` or infinity in valid JSON.\n\nA live Admin API request is not used because repository policy requires fixture/stub validation for parser behavior unless a real provider probe is explicitly requested.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OpenAIAPIUsageFetcherTests` (12 passed)\n- `make check` (0 formatting or lint violations)\n- `make test` (the unrelated Claude credential shard exceeded its 180-second group timeout; its `ClaudeDirectUsageFallbackTests` retry passed, then the credential-storage retry stalled in this sandbox; stopped without any failure in the changed OpenAI suite)\n\n\n## Production-path fixture proof\n\nA temporary standalone executable linked against `CodexBarCore` called the public `OpenAIAPIUsageFetcher.fetchUsage` with an in-memory HTTP transport. This is outside Swift Testing and does not use live Admin API credentials. The temporary target was removed after the run.\n\n```text\n$ swift run --disable-sandbox --scratch-path .build OpenAIProof\nBuild of product OpenAIProof complete!\nfixture=NaN result=rejected endpoint=costs\nfixture=Infinity result=rejected endpoint=costs\nfixture=1e309 result=rejected endpoint=costs\n```\n\nAll malformed values are rejected by the shipping fetch/decode/error path at the costs endpoint.",
